Let's go—we'll follow
the instructor now.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.066
Follow the instructor.

00:05:06.766 --> 00:05:09.533
It's really big—not in terms of scale,
but in terms of size.

00:05:09.533 --> 00:05:14.966
So you can just wear it (the raincoat) over your clothes first,
Little Fox. Last time in Japan...

00:05:14.966 --> 00:05:18.500
You can just wear it over your clothes,
and then we'll take it off when we get there.

00:05:27.266 --> 00:05:29.566
Make an "approaching" move.

