right up it; everyone makes it to the top.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.266
If you stick to drier areas,
you should be fine.

00:05:50.633 --> 00:05:52.166
The rope is thinner,

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:53.233
so tie it in two loops.
This one is smaller.

00:05:53.566 --> 00:05:57.366
Like I said just now,
our main line is smaller.

00:05:57.566 --> 00:06:00.166
So we make two loops—two
turns. We just walk up,

00:06:01.233 --> 00:06:05.566
and that’s why shoes are
so important, right?

00:06:05.666 --> 00:06:07.566
Megagrip—super slip
-resistant—just push,

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.766
