Everyone, now that we've made it down from the peaks,
let's head back to the entrance.

00:43:30.766 --> 00:43:34.600
I highly, highly recommend this route
through the Shen Shan mountain range.

00:43:34.600 --> 00:43:36.200
Thumb Peak for everyone.
If you're in Taiwan,

00:43:36.200 --> 00:43:39.633
I'm sure you love climbing Taiwan's
"100 Peaks" just as much as I do.

00:43:39.633 --> 00:43:41.866
You're sure to love this route through
the Shen Mountain range.

